  BinaryOpsReverse.cs, CustomSerialization.cs and SiPolicy.cs are copied from
  https://github.com/HotCakeX/Harden-Windows-Security/tree/cae9c81a50634952300b145c5bb8db0f048c74b0/AppControl%20Manager/SiPolicy
  (MIT), with generated IDs changed from random GUIDs to binary indexes for deterministic output.
